  "description": "A complete .NET 10 client library for MercadoBitcoin API v4 with native HTTP/2 and optional HTTP/3 support, using System.Text.Json with source generators. Access to all public & private endpoints: trading, wallet, account. Features: resilient retry (Polly v8), cancellation tokens everywhere, custom User-Agent, native metrics (System.Diagnostics.Metrics counters + latency histogram), comprehensive test suite, clean architecture, AOT compatibility, Source Generators.",
